findings.remediation:
Validate workflow_dispatch URL inputs against an allowlist of trusted domains before passing them to the test runner. Alternatively, only attach the bypass header when the target URL matches a known MonetizeKit/Vercel deployment pattern (e.g., *.monetizekit.delivery). A simple fix in playwright.config.ts:

```typescript
const TRUSTED_HOSTS = ['monetizekit.delivery', 'monetizekit.app', 'localhost'];
const isTrusted = (url: string) => TRUSTED_HOSTS.some(h => new URL(url).hostname.endsWith(h));
const extraHTTPHeaders = bypass && isTrusted(taskflowUrl) ? { "x-vercel-protection-bypass": bypass } : undefined;
```
